.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-env-setup - Generate .env files from schemas and initialize .cursor/mcp.env


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit env setup [path] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Scans for .env.schema.yaml contracts and generates .env files populated with default values and strict 0600 permissions.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--force\fP[=false]
	Overwrite existing .env files with schema defaults

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for setup


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit-env(1)\fP
